        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Water Travel"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(primal, transmutation, water)\n\nA water orm can dissolve into water, appearing only as a long, dark, serpentine stretch of water. While in this form, a water orm's swim Speed increases to 600 feet, it automatically succeeds at Athletics checks to swim, and it gains a +4 circumstance bonus to Stealth checks in water. A water orm can remain in this form for 8 hours, but it can't enter salt water when using this ability. A water orm can return to its normal form using a single action which has the concentrate trait."
            },
            "action_type": {
              "value": "none"
            },
